  "note": "After yami (Trendorin/yami, MIT): a pixel-art desktop in dark graphite with one accent — square windows with a one-pixel border, a thin top bar with square workspace cells and cpu / ram scales, flat panels with a hard pixel shadow, the pixel Tiny5 font in the whole shell, quick motion.",
